# Every machine carries its own light (MachineModel): optics that burn faintly
# always, a working part that warms across the whole tell to its brightest at
# the strike, all of it scaled by how dark it is (darkness()). Ten machines on
# the coast at night, then the same ten at noon where the light has to stay
# subtle, and what ten lit machines cost a frame against none.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/machine_lights.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --stats
coast calm
place spawn
zoom 16
hour 23
wait 1.0
perf stats begin
wait 10.0
perf stats end no-machines-night
spawn harvester
spawn cutter
spawn hauler
spawn sweeper
spawn watcher
spawn harvester
spawn cutter
spawn hauler
spawn sweeper
spawn watcher
wait 1.0
perf stats begin
wait 10.0
perf stats end ten-machines-night
shot 01-ten-machines-at-night-by-their-own-light with mob:harvester,mob:cutter,mob:hauler,mob:sweeper,mob:watcher
hour 12
wait 1.0
perf stats begin
wait 10.0
perf stats end ten-machines-noon
shot 02-the-same-ten-at-noon-subtle with mob:harvester,mob:watcher
